Package: SEMFC
Title: Structural equation modeling with factors and composites within the framework of the basic design.
Version: 1.0
Authors@R:
  c(person("Alain", "Luong", , 
           "alain.luong@centralesupelec.fr", 
           role = c("aut", "rev")),
           person("Arthur", "Tenenhaus", , 
           "arthur.tenenhaus@centralesupelec.fr", 
           role = c("aut", "cre", "rev", "ths")))
Description: This package implements two estimation methods for Structural Equation modeling with factors and composites within the framework of the basic design. The packages proposes SVD-SEM which relies on a non-iterative SVD-based algorithm for parameter estimation, producing consistent and asymptotically normal estimators. Additionally, the restricted maximum-likelihood approach (RML-SEM) for the basic design with factors and composites is also proposed. SVD-SEM can serve as an initial solution for RML-SEM. 
